# Cloudflare Pages redirect/proxy rules (Pages Direct Upload only).
# This file is IGNORED when the backend Worker serves the static files.

# ── Recommended: same-origin API proxy ────────────────────────────
# Keep the frontend and API on ONE origin so session cookies work
# with zero CORS configuration. Replace the target with your deployed
# backend Worker URL, then remove the leading "# " to activate:
#
# /api/* https://botdock-cloud.YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev/:splat 200

# ── SPA-style convenience (optional) ─────────────────────────────
# Send visitors to pretty paths instead of *.html (Pages serves the
# file when it exists; this only catches misses):
#
# /dashboard /dashboard.html 200
# /bots /bots.html 200
# /deploy /deploy.html 200
# /pricing /pricing.html 200
# /settings /settings.html 200
# /login /login.html 200
# /register /register.html 200
# /docs /docs.html 200
